#: ../../source/hat/hat18650c.rst:4 04fd70fa58dd4b51b70332e37ed2cfd4
msgid "HAT 18650C"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hat/hat18650c.rst:12 f0d3a1caf433447884389943691ac358
msgid ""
"HAT 18650C V1.1 integrates an AW32257 charger and an INA226 power "
"monitor. It can measure battery voltage, current, and power, control "
"battery charging, set charge current, read charge status/fault status, "
"and control the AW32257 Boost/OTG output."
msgstr "HAT 18650C V1.1 集成 AW32257 充电管理芯片和 INA226 功率监测芯片，可测量电池电压、电流和功率，控制电池充电、设置充电电流、读取充电状态及故障状态，并控制 AW32257 Boost/OTG 输出。"

#: ../../source/hat/hat18650c.rst:17 532963c43a534075a1fa30ab5d768c8c
msgid "Support the following products:"
msgstr "支持以下产品："

